  "description": "Export channel-mix probes P5-P8 and P12 (export-plan-compiler.md section 4, R-085, decision 087): field A on BaseColor in the Raw colour space, grey A bound into the L8 SpecularRoughness channel; srcChannel L of BaseColor, srcChannel A of SpecularRoughness and of BaseColor, an absent Opacity as alpha, black-only maps (L and RGB), and the curvature mesh map of a fresh project (nothing baked or bound). Each probe step names an authored export configuration (the recorder's preset uzp_recorder, PNG 16, no dithering, infinite padding, root paths s0 and s1, changed as the probe says); the recorder lists it with list_project_textures and, when that succeeds, exports it, recording Painter's answer or refusal, the directory content and the files.",
